Labnet consensus parameters for Bitcoin Core v32.0, in the mainnet section.

SegWit is active from the genesis block (Taproot already is: since v32.0 it is
buried, active everywhere but one historical mainnet block). The chain has a
single small miner, so the difficulty is never retargeted, and there is no
minimum chain work or assumed-valid block. powLimit stays at the mainnet value,
so the difficulty never drops below 1.

--- a/src/kernel/chainparams.cpp
+++ b/src/kernel/chainparams.cpp
